@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Cluster a owl:Class.
hpc:Account a owl:Class.
hpc:User a owl:Class.
hpc:Partition a owl:Class.
hpc:Association a owl:Class.
hpc:Database a owl:Class.
hpc:Grafana a owl:Class.
hpc:Influxdb a owl:Class.
hpc:Prometheus a owl:Class.

hpc:addcluster a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:addaccount a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:adduser a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:createaccountassociation a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:Hascluster rdfs:domain hpc:Association
